  "mechanism": "retry amplification: shared client (httpclient 3.2.0 in checkout-svc 1.9.0) now retries timeouts/5xx up to 4 times with a 250ms per-attempt timeout and no backoff; slow large-charge calls are abandoned and repeated, payment calls multiply (~5/s -> ~20/s), and the concurrent duplicate charge attempts make payment-svc fail with SQLite 'database is locked' and UNIQUE-constraint errors (HTTP 500), so orders fail. The payment-side DB errors are a consequence, not the root cause",
